span style="color:#d93025!important">e</span></span></div><div class="wp-google-wr"><a href="https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw" onclick="return rplg_leave_review_window.call(this)" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">review us on<svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></a></div></div></div></div><div class="rpi-slides-root grw-content"><div class="grw-content-inner"><button class="rpi-ltgt rpi-lt grw-prev" tabindex="0"></button><div class="rpi-slides grw-reviews rpi-slides-bite" data-count="10" data-offset="10"><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Mindri Ureña profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_e9e8833c54d4abda90e23a6f0febe975.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101861222635953781367/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Mindri Ureña</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1741099048">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">The staff at Casa Privéé are incredibly attentive and professional, providing top-tier service from start to finish. They make you feel welcome and comfortable, ensuring a seamless experience throughout your visit. The hyperbaric chamber at the facility is truly state-of-the-art, offering a unique and effective therapy session that enhances overall well-being. With both exceptional staff and cutting-edge equipment, Casa Privéé offers an unparalleled experience.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Victoria Vina profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_598939d907ad15e510e6836413559d83.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109126671838368436143/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Victoria Vina</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740679547">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:4"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">Casa privee has been a treatment center for my dad for a while now as we see a difference in his health we are not very fond of the doctor he is not a personable person and shows zero emotion towards a patient who is under going serious treatments. On the other hand their staff is amazing if anything those are the ones that keep us going specifically their nurse she so helpful and kind my dad speaks so highly of her. We would definitely recommend Casa privee based on staff and treatment results, not on doctor.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Ellie Platt profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_1cc4b88e87aba4f5014a879fc0912f8c.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114078815515553781652/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Ellie Platt</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740679503">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">Everyone here is so friendly and professional! From the moment I walked in, the front desk staff made me feel welcome, and the technicians were incredibly helpful and reassuring. It’s rare to find a place that’s both inviting and efficient—I’m so glad I chose to come here!</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Melie Viera profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_9d61c3e1fbb5519502e38ee92ad4675b.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117516673139424208263/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Melie Viera</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740678223">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">State of the art facility with a staff that takes care of your every need. I had been looking for a hyperbaric chamber for years in Miami. This is the real deal not compressed air, real oxygen.  I will be a guest there for the rest of my life.</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col12 grw-review-inner grw-backgnd"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-row12-center"><div class="grw-img-wrap"><img alt="Nakita Gutierrez profile picture" class="grw-img" height="50" loading="lazy" onerror="if(this.src!='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png')this.src='https://www.casaprivee.com/wp-content/plugins/widget-google-reviews/assets/img/guest.png';" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/11/ChIJdexFM8u32YgRiHtR6znSzuw_93276e9d2cd7c103358b128c68447343.jpg" width="50"/></div><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col6"><a class="wp-google-name" href="https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112297378318894430133/reviews" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Nakita Gutierrez</a><div class="wp-google-time" data-lang="en" data-time="1740677656">2 years ago</div></div></div><span class="rpi-stars" style="--rating:5"></span><div class="rpi-flx rpi-col4"><div class="wp-google-feedback grw-scroll"><span class="wp-google-text">My experience with Casa Privee was nothing short of amazing, from easy booking options to being welcomed with warm compassionate staff members 10/10 recommended</span></div></div><svg height="16" role="none" width="16"><use href="#grw-google"></use></svg></div></div><div class="rpi-slide grw-review"><div class="rpi-flx rpi-co